        },
        "quote": "(a) Transient Vendors. It shall be unlawful for any transient vendor to do any of the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "03a34c0b-24c2-5a4e-80bf-7135b3cb00a5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 227,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:1",
          "start": 97
        },
        "quote": "(1) Conduct business or carry on activities in violation of any zoning ordinances or requirements, including setback requirements.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "b1a3573a-0d35-5ade-965e-1907c82d1af2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 292,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:2",
          "start": 228
        },
        "quote": "(2) Conduct business between the hours of midnight and 8:00 a.m.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "89a5e95d-a5d2-5388-bbc6-e7c4cd061200",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 519,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:3",
          "start": 293
        },
        "quote": "(3) Conduct business in such a way as would restrict or interfere with the ingress or egress of abutting property owners or tenants, increase traffic congestion or obstruct adequate access to fire, police or utility employees.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "3b5cfe4b-28df-561a-b20f-77d80596bd12",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 748,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:4",
          "start": 520
        },
        "quote": "(4) Use any electronic device for amplification in an outdoor area or to otherwise create, or gather people who create, noise sufficient so as to disturb the peace, quiet or repose of surrounding residential or commercial areas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "7cea7139-655d-56dc-8d90-a6eda5ae94ca",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 919,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:5",
          "start": 749
        },
        "quote": "(5) Fail to allow law enforcement officers or City employees to enter into or upon the premises or to otherwise interfere with any inspection of the premises or business.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "5be5600c-5bee-5152-bcef-df0210230c93",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1121,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:6",
          "start": 920
        },
        "quote": "(6) Fail to have a trash receptacle at the location. Immediately upon cessation of vending, the vendor shall remove and properly dispose of all trash and litter associated with the vendor’s activities.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "755f0186-0af6-5f1d-9273-7eb89de8825c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1206,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:7",
          "start": 1122
        },
        "quote": "(7) Erect or construct any structure, tent or building greater than 120 square feet.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "4e67546f-cb75-59b5-9a47-1a66bf337ae5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1351,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:8",
          "start": 1207
        },
        "quote": "(8) Conduct business or carry on activities within 50 feet of any driveway entrance or access lane from a public street to an existing business.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.115.050 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "92f0688f-16eb-5f55-9e99-2eea37d02634",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1465,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:9",
          "start": 1352
        },
        "quote": "(9) Conduct or carry on more than one transient vendor business or activity on the same property at any one time.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.050:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
